WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.666 --> 00:00:06.829
(tense electronic music)

00:00:06.829 --> 00:00:08.738
- For a year of my life,

00:00:08.738 --> 00:00:11.555
I lived in a cabin in
the woods without any

00:00:11.555 --> 00:00:15.224
running water, plumbing or electricity.

00:00:15.224 --> 00:00:17.039
- I sang opera for five years.

00:00:17.039 --> 00:00:20.539
I can sing in Italian, German, and French.

00:00:22.511 --> 00:00:23.344
I have six tattoos.

00:00:23.344 --> 00:00:24.590
They all have meaning
to me and they remind me

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:28.245
every day of what matters most in life.

00:00:28.245 --> 00:00:31.645
- I once swallowed my tongue piercing and

00:00:31.645 --> 00:00:33.145
I owned a 9mm gun.

00:00:34.104 --> 00:00:36.244
- When I was a kid, I was
a competitive arm wrestler

00:00:36.244 --> 00:00:40.411
and spent my Sundays
dirt-biking through the woods.

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:43.380
I have around 15 tattoos.

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:45.803
I've kind of stopped counting
but I really enjoy it

00:00:45.803 --> 00:00:47.871
because it's a cool way to commemorate

00:00:47.871 --> 00:00:52.138
certain parts of my life
permanently on my body.

00:00:52.138 --> 00:00:55.218
- I once went to Spain
for the sole purpose

00:00:55.218 --> 00:00:57.535
of being chased by a herd of bulls.

00:00:57.535 --> 00:00:58.672
- My senior year of high school,

00:00:58.672 --> 00:01:00.444
I was suspended for three days and

00:01:00.444 --> 00:01:02.694
banned from my Senior Prom.

00:01:05.956 --> 00:01:08.744
- I have seven tattoos
and I like them because

00:01:08.744 --> 00:01:12.409
they make me look tough
until I open my mouth.

00:01:12.409 --> 00:01:15.826
(tense electronic music)

